Adds ${add.length} search${add.length === 1 ? "" : "es"} to this site's search-loop \`seeds\`: each is what ChatGPT searched (${week}, Temporary Chat, Web search on) while answering a buyer question where ${site.label} did not show up. The engine (v1.17.0) puts each through every check a found search meets before any page is written.

${add.map((s) => `- \`${s.query}\`${s.wants ? ` (wants: ${s.wants.join(", ")})` : ""} — from Q${s.q}: "${gaps.find((g) => g.n === s.q)?.asked}"; ChatGPT searched ${gaps.find((g) => g.n === s.q)?.queries.map((q) => `"${q}"`).join(", ")}`).join("\n")}
